{"ticker":"MKC","updated":"2026-10-30T22:58:58Z","profile":{"longName":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated","shortName":"McCormick & Company, Incorporat","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mccormickcorporation.com","fullTimeEmployees":14100,"marketCap":12724059136,"trailingPE":8.551537,"forwardPE":14.679998,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.6555498,"pegRatio":3.06,"targetMeanPrice":54.455,"targetHighPrice":65.0,"targetLowPrice":47.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.174,"earningsGrowth":-0.571,"grossMargins":0.38914,"operatingMargins":0.1776,"profitMargins":0.19393,"totalRevenue":7685700096,"beta":0.641,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":72.41,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":43.25,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.1},"summary":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated manufactures, markets, and distributes herbs, spices, seasoning mixes, condiments, and other flavorful products to the food industry. It operates in two segments, Consumer and Flavor Solutions. The Consumer segment offers spices, herbs, and seasonings, as well as condiments, sauces, and desserts. This segment markets its products under the McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot, Lawry's, Cholula Hot Sauce, Club House, Gourmet Garden, and OLD BAY brands in the Americas; Ducros, Schwartz, Kamis, LA Drogheria, and Vahiné brands in Europe, the Middle East, and Africa; and McCormick and DaQiao brands in the Asia/Pacific (APAC), as well as desserts under the Aeroplane brand; and packaged chilled herbs under the Gourmet Garden brand. Its authentic regional brands include Zatarain's, Stubb's, Thai Kitchen, and Simply Asia. The company also supplies its products under private labels. This segment serves retailers, including grocery, mass merchandise, warehouse clubs, discount and drug stores, and e-commerce retailers directly and indirectly through distributors and wholesale foodservice suppliers. The Flavor Solutions segment offers seasoning blends, spices, herbs, condiments, coating systems, and compound flavors to multinational food manufacturers and foodservice customers. It serves foodservice customers directly and indirectly through distributors. The","summary_zh":"味好美公司為食品業製造、行銷和分銷香草、香料、混合調味料、調味品和其他風味產品。它分為兩個部門：消費者解決方案部門和風味解決方案部門。消費者部門提供香料、香草和調味料，以及調味品、醬汁和甜點。該部門在美洲以 McCormick、French's、Frank's RedHot、Lawry's、Cholula Hot Sauce、Club House、Gourmet Garden 和 OLD BAY 品牌銷售其產品；歐洲、中東和非洲的 Ducros、Schwartz、Kamis、LA Drogheria 和 Vahiné 品牌；亞太地區甜點（APACm）的好美味和美味品牌的美味品牌和品牌（McCormets）以及亞太地區的甜點（APACm）並以各種美品牌（McCormet）以及好品牌的美味品牌（McCormeti Garden）並以各種美品牌（McCormet）以及好品牌的美味品牌（McCormet）並以精美品牌的好美品牌（McCorm）以及好品牌（McCorm）搭配甜點和品牌（McCorm）搭配精美品牌的好美品牌並以完美品牌（McCorm）以及美味品牌的好美品牌並以美品牌以及新品牌並以完美品牌的完美品牌擁有完美品牌和完美品牌。品牌包裝冷凍香草。其正宗的區域品牌包括 Zatarain's、Stubb's、Thai Kitchen 和 Simply Asia。該公司還以自有品牌供應其產品。該部門直接或透過經銷商和批發食品服務供應商間接為零售商（包括雜貨店、大眾商品店、倉儲俱樂部、折扣店和藥局以及電子商務零售商）提供服務。調味品解決方案部門為跨國食品製造商和餐飲服務客戶提供混合調味品、香料、香草、調味品、塗層系統和複合調味品。它直接或透過分銷商間接為餐飲服務客戶提供服務。這","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"包裝食品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":70.38,"h":70.85,"l":68.38,"c":68.8,"v":2469600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":68.94,"h":69.9,"l":68.55,"c":69.84,"v":1825900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":70.19,"h":70.58,"l":69.78,"c":70.13,"v":1765800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":70.27,"h":71.63,"l":70.2,"c":70.91,"v":2584000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":70.5,"h":70.52,"l":69.51,"c":70.15,"v":2585200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":69.89,"h":70.25,"l":69.51,"c":69.63,"v":1591900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":69.22,"h":69.4,"l":67.71,"c":68.58,"v":2425300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":68.94,"h":70.22,"l":68.58,"c":69.81,"v":2008000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":69.45,"h":69.89,"l":68.63,"c":68.95,"v":1795900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":69.34,"h":69.54,"l":65.95,"c":65.95,"v":3202700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":66.11,"h":67.64,"l":66.1,"c":67.11,"v":2273600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":67.05,"h":67.7,"l":66.59,"c":66.81,"v":1538400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":66.49,"h":66.84,"l":65.96,"c":66.25,"v":1795800},{"t":"2025-09