l4YzUxNE9Oa1haeW5VbVB2N24xcWhka0dGOUdhYkp6UkJKaklINng1cHA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"麥考密克公司 (NYSE:MKC) 股價下跌 1.3% - 是時候賣出了？"},{"title":"McCormick (MKC) Stock Looks Reasonably Priced On Its $45B Food Deal","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"味好美 (MKC) 股票在其 45B 美元的食品交易中看起來定價合理"},{"title":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated (NYSE:MKC) Shares Up 5% - Here's Why","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPV1VkMVF2a2hQNU9CQWV2d18wSDVETXFqc05JYlo3ZG9qRXo1LTlWaWZZLUpYcTVRaVg2ZWhHRHZha1BMd1QzaG9jOGRsZGNLU0lHSEZBX09nNUg4bjcyaERvWTEwcHV4Ul9xb25lYXYwNkZodHFKTE5wdUxwWW9fNVhNQzlrU0syX2tQV3dWQ1pIc0g1aHdpekVmOG9EX3BCSGVXcEs4d19XRkNZd2FGeHI5X1lwRlVIM0RZcElR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"味好美公司 (NYSE:MKC) 股價上漲 5% - 原因如下"},{"title":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated (NYSE:MKC) Stock Price Down 2.5% - Here's What Happened","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"味好美公司 (NYSE:MKC) 股價下跌 2.5% - 以下是發生的情況"}],"order_news":[{"title":"McCormick Sales Volume Falls 2.5%—US Brand Loyalty Crumbles Under High Inflation","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE8yTEtObm4zWjJVZXJCMlNhOGJ4TGtPcFRQMDRFT25tVEZEOFFvRFZsczNnazVmMHVHX3kzY09nM2kzYkN0MjZ4V3JCbTdfUUVpMTFDLVFfVlUwN1BJdEFwaTNXYklnTVQydlBOUThJcVotMDg2akE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-03","zh":"味好美銷量下降 2.5%——高通膨下美國品牌忠誠度崩潰"},{"title":"[McCormick & Q3 2026 Earnings Call] McCormick Raises Inflation Forecast to 7%, Holds Margin Outlook as Q4 Compression Looms","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE8xSzh2bGpZajNjaWNvM2JwQ2U0ZUV0cUVyeE1mYjlHTTFxR3czVG9aaEtOcElacVZNTmRoRi1samdPZDJNVWhsblBYbURYMTN4R0pDUzEyR1M0NFJu?oc=5","date":"2026-10-01","zh":"[麥考密克 & 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] 麥考密克將通膨預測上調至 7%，因第四季壓縮迫在眉睫，維持利潤展望"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-22","period":"2025-11-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/63754/000006375426000037/mkc-20251130.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"McCormick is a global leader in flavor. We manufacture, market, and distribute herbs, spices, seasoning mixes, condiments, and other flavorful products to the entire food and beverage industry: retailers, food manufacturers, and foodservice businesses. We also are partners in a number of joint ventures that are involved in the manufacture and sale of flavorful products, the most significant of which is McCormick de Mexico. Our major sales, distribution, and production facilities are located in North America, Europe, and China. Additional facilities are based in Australia, Central America, Thailand, and South Africa.","zh":"味好美是全球調味料領域的領導者。我們為整個食品和飲料行業（零售商、食品製造商和餐飲服務企業）製造、銷售和分銷香草、香料、混合調味料、調味品和其他風味產品。我們也是多家從事風味產品製造和銷售的合資企業的合作夥伴，其中最重要的是 McCormick de Mexico。我們的主要銷售、分銷和生產設施位於北美、歐洲和中國。其他工廠位於澳洲、中美洲、泰國和南非。"},{"en":"On January 2, 2026, we completed the purchase of an additional 25% ownership interest in McCormick de Mexico. The purchase price was $750 million, which increased our ownership to a 75% controlling interest. We believe the acquisition creates opportunities for further growth in the Mexican market and provides a strategic platform for further expansion in Latin America. McCormick de Mexico is a prominent food company in Mexico, with a broad portfolio, including mayonnaise, spices, marmalades, mustard, hot sauce, and tea, sold under McCormick brands.","zh":"2026 年 1 月 2 日，我們完成了 McCormick de Mexico 額外 25% 股權的購買。收購價格為 7.5 億美元，這使我們的控股權增加到 75%。我們相信，此次收購為墨西哥市場的進一步成長創造了機會，並為在拉丁美洲的進一步擴張提供了策略平台。 McCormick de Mexico 是墨西哥著名的食品公司，擁有廣泛的產品組合，包括蛋黃醬、香料、果醬、芥末、辣醬和茶，並以 McCormick 品牌銷售。"},{"en":"We operate in two business segments: Consumer and Flavor Solutions. Demand for flavor is growing globally, and across both segments, we have the customer base and product breadth to participate in all types of eating occasions. Our products deliver flavor when cooking at home, dining out, purchasing a quick service restaurant meal, or enjoying a snack. We offer our customers and consumers a range of products, extending from premium to value-priced, to meet the increasing demand for certain product attributes including clean-label, organic, natural, reduced sodium, gluten-free, and non-GMO (genetically modified organisms).","zh":"我們經營兩個業務部門：消費者和風味解決方案。全球對風味的需求正在增長，在這兩個細分市場中，我們擁有參與所有類型飲食場合的客戶群和產品廣度。我們的產品在在家做飯、外出用餐、在餐廳購買快餐或享用小吃時都能提供風味。我們為客戶和消費者提供從優質到超值的一系列產品，以滿足對某些產品屬性日益增長的需求，包括清潔標籤、有機、天然、低鈉、無麩質和非 GMO（基因改造生物）。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We operate in two business segments: Consumer and Flavor Solutions. Demand for flavor is growing globally, and across both segments, we have the customer base and product breadth to participate in all types of eating occasions. Our products deliver flavor when cooking at home, dining out, purchasing a quick service restaurant meal, or enjoying a snack. We offer our customers and consumers a range of products, extending from premium to value-priced, to meet the increasing demand for certain product attributes including clean-label, organic, natural, reduced sodium, gluten-free, and non-GMO (genetically modified organisms).","zh":"我們經營兩個業務部門：消費者和風味解決方案。全球對風味的需求正在增長，在這兩個細分市場中，我們擁有參與所有類型飲食場合的客戶群和產品廣度。我們的產品在在家做飯、外出用餐、在餐廳購買快餐或享用小吃時都能提供風味。我們為客戶和消費者提供從優質到超值的一系列產品，以滿足對某些產品屬性日益增長的需求，包括清潔標籤、有機、天然、低鈉、無麩質和非 GMO（基因改造生物）。"},{"en":"Consistent with market conditions in each segment, our Consumer segment has a higher overall profit margin than our Flavor Solutions segment. In 2025, the Consumer segment contributed approximately 58% of consolidated net sales and 67% of consolidated operating income, and the Flavor Solutions segment contributed approximately 42% of consolidated net sales and 33% of consolidated operating income.","zh":"與每個細分市場的市場狀況一致，我們的消費者細分市場的整體利潤率高於風味解決方案細分市場。 2025年，消費者業務部門貢獻了約58%的合併淨銷售額和67%的合併營業收入，風味解決方案部門貢獻了約42%的合併淨銷售額和33%的合併營業收入。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our products are sold directly to customers as well as through brokers, wholesalers, and distributors. In the Consumer segment, products are then sold to consumers under a number of brands through a variety of retail channels, including grocery, mass merchandise, warehouse clubs, discount and drug stores, and e-commerce. In the Flavor Solutions segment, products are used by food and beverage manufacturers as ingredients in their finished goods and by foodservice customers for menu items, as well as provided to their own customers for dine-in and take-out occasions, all to enhance the flavor of their foods. Customers in the Flavor Solutions segment include food manufacturers and the foodservice industry, supplied through a variety of channels, including directly and indirectly through distributors, wholesale foodservice suppliers, and e-commerce.","zh":"我們的產品直接銷售給客戶，也透過經紀人、批發商和經銷商銷售。在消費者領域，產品透過各種零售管道以多個品牌出售給消費者，包括雜貨店、大宗商品、倉儲俱樂部、折扣店和藥局以及電子商務。在風味解決方案領域，產品被食品和飲料製造商用作其成品的成分，並被餐飲服務客戶用作菜單項，並提供給自己的客戶用於堂食和外賣場合，所有這些都是為了增強食品的風味。風味解決方案部門的客戶包括食品製造商和餐飲服務業，透過各種管道（包括直接和間接透過分銷商、批發食品服務供應商和電子商務）供應。"},{"en":"We have a large number of customers for our products. Sales to one of our Consumer segment customers, Wal-Mart Stores, Inc., accounted for consolidated sales of approximately 12% in 2025, 2024, and 2023. Sales to one of our Flavor Solutions segment customers, PepsiCo, Inc., accounted for consolidated sales of approximately 12% in 2025, and 13% in both 2024 and 2023. In 2025, 2024, and 2023, the top three customers in our Flavor Solutions segment represented 49% of our global Flavor Solutions sales.","zh":"我們的產品擁有大量客戶。 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年，向我們的消費者細分市場客戶之一沃爾瑪百貨公司 (Wal-Mart Stores, Inc.) 的銷售佔綜合銷售額約 12%。向我們的風味解決方案細分市場客戶之一百事可樂公司 (PepsiCo, Inc.) 的銷售在 2025 年約佔綜合銷售額的 12%，在 2024 年和 2023 年均佔 13%。在 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年，到 2023 年，我們風味解決方案領域的三大客戶占我們全球風味解決方案銷售額的 49%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Each segment operates in highly competitive markets around the world. In this environment, our growth strategies include customer engagement and product innovation based on consumer insights. In the Consumer segment, we are building brand recognition and loyalty through advertising and promotions. In our Flavor Solutions segment, we differentiate ourselves through culinary and consumer-inspired flavor development, as well as the breadth of our product offering and customer engagement.","zh":"每個部門都在全球競爭激烈的市場中運作。在這種環境下，我們的成長策略包括客戶參與和基於消費者洞察的產品創新。在消費者領域，我們透過廣告和促銷來建立品牌認知度和忠誠度。在我們的風味解決方案領域，我們透過烹飪和消費者啟發的風味開發以及產品供應的廣度和客戶參與來使自己脫穎而出。"},{"en":"We are subject to numerous laws and regulations around the world that apply to our global businesses. In the U.S., the safety, production, transportation, distribution, advertising, labeling, and sale of many of our products and their ingredients are subject to the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act; the Food Safety Modernization Act; the Federal Trade Commission Act; state consumer protection laws; competition laws; anti-corruption laws; customs and trade laws; federal, state and local workplace health and safety laws; privacy laws; federal, state, and local environmental protection laws; and other federal, state, and local statutes and regulations. Outside the U.S., our business is subject to numerous similar statutes, laws, and regulatory requirements.","zh":"我們遵守世界各地適用於我們全球業務的眾多法律和法規。在美國，我們的許多產品及其成分的安全、生產、運輸、分銷、廣告、標籤和銷售均受聯邦食品、藥品和化妝品法案的約束； 《食品安全現代化法》；聯邦貿易委員會法；州消費者保護法；競爭法；反腐敗法；海關和貿易法；聯邦、州和地方工作場所健康和安全法；在美國境外，我們的業務受到許多類似的法規、法律和監管要求的約束。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-11-30","items":[{"name":"Consumer","val":3950300000,"zh":"消費者"},{"name":"Flavor Solutions","val":2890000000,"zh":"風味解決方案"}],"total":6840300000},"geo":{"end":"2025-11-30","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":4867800000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":4168300000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":1403500000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"Europe Middle East & Africa","val":1268500000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":704000000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":6840300000}},"peers":["HRL","SJM","CLX","GWW","GPC"]}}